[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) was marked known: one bug, one fix queued. The desk's own table on
that page shows two causes, and only one of them was ever going to be fixed. Each now has its
own ticket, and engineering closed #4471 on 5 October.

<ProblemTable ticket={4471}
  tickets={{
